WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.995 --> 00:00:18.426
Before handover, list every defect in the Fix List.

2
00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:25.631
Close each fix when it's done.

3
00:00:25.681 --> 00:00:29.807
When no mandatory fix is open, record the handover…

4
00:00:29.857 --> 00:00:37.630
…and download the handover certificate. Done!
